   "missileSpeed": 1200.0,
   "name": "Way of the Wanderer",
   "tooltip": "<spellPassive>Resolve:</spellPassive> Moving grants <keywordMajor>Flow</keywordMajor>, which is tracked on Yasuo's resource bar. Moving faster grants more <keywordMajor>Flow</keywordMajor>. At maximum <keywordMajor>Flow</keywordMajor>, damage from a champion or monster briefly grants <shield>@ShieldValue@ Shield</shield>.<br><br><spellPassive>Intent:</spellPassive> Yasuo's Critical Strike Chance is increased by @CritChanceMultiplier*100@% but his Critical Strike Damage is reduced to @CurrentCritDamage@. Gain <physicalDamage>@YasuoCritToAD*.01@ Bonus Attack Damage</physicalDamage> for every 1% Critical Strike Chance above 100%.",
   "summary": "Yasuo's Critical Strike Chance is increased. Additionally, Yasuo builds toward a shield whenever he is moving. The shield triggers when he takes damage from a champion or monster."
